{"parse": {"title": "凡人或英雄-02", "pageid": 147017, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%87%A1%E4%BA%BA%E6%88%96%E8%8B%B1%E9%9B%84-01\" title=\"凡人或英雄-01\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">凡人或英雄-02</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%87%A1%E4%BA%BA%E6%88%96%E8%8B%B1%E9%9B%84-03\" title=\"凡人或英雄-03\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">凡人或英雄</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">02</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E5.BE.B7.E5.B0.94.E6.96.90.E4.B9.8B.E9.97.A8\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"德尔斐之门\">德尔斐之门</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 德尔斐之门</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Wisdom in Stone</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_9_bg_09.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_9_bg_09\"><img alt=\"3_9_bg_09\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b0/Cg-3_9_bg_09.png/600px-Cg-3_9_bg_09.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b0/Cg-3_9_bg_09.png/900px-Cg-3_9_bg_09.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b0/Cg-3_9_bg_09.png/1200px-Cg-3_9_bg_09.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>远天积攒着浓厚的黑云，赤红色的岩浆喷入天空，伴着轰隆作响的可怖雷声。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_9_bg_13.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_9_bg_13\"><img alt=\"3_9_bg_13\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/Cg-3_9_bg_13.png/600px-Cg-3_9_bg_13.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/Cg-3_9_bg_13.png/900px-Cg-3_9_bg_13.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/Cg-3_9_bg_13.png/1200px-Cg-3_9_bg_13.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>赫多涅站在山地高处，眺望海洋中央猛烈的风暴。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"315601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/HeadIconSmall-315601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-315601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"315601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/HeadIconSmall-315601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-315601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/HeadIconSmall-315601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-315601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>那里面大概是座火山，但气象太过反常……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"656601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/50/HeadIconSmall-656601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-656601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"656601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/50/HeadIconSmall-656601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-656601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/50/HeadIconSmall-656601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-656601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿加尼佩：</div><div>赫多涅！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"315616.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-315616.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-315616.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"315616.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-315616.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-315616.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-315616.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-315616.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>里面究竟会盘踞着什么怪物……蛇发女妖，鸟身怪，还是独眼巨人？</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_9_bg_09.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_9_bg_09\"><img alt=\"3_9_bg_09\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b0/Cg-3_9_bg_09.png/600px-Cg-3_9_bg_09.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b0/Cg-3_9_bg_09.png/900px-Cg-3_9_bg_09.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b0/Cg-3_9_bg_09.png/1200px-Cg-3_9_bg_09.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"656601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/50/HeadIconSmall-656601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-656601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"656601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/50/HeadIconSmall-656601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-656601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/50/HeadIconSmall-656601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-656601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿加尼佩：</div><div>赫多涅！！！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_9_bg_10.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_9_bg_10\"><img alt=\"3_9_bg_10\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/19/Cg-3_9_bg_10.png/600px-Cg-3_9_bg_10.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/19/Cg-3_9_bg_10.png/900px-Cg-3_9_bg_10.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/19/Cg-3_9_bg_10.png/1200px-Cg-3_9_bg_10.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>赫多涅这才听到了身后同伴的呼唤。她转过身，露出了一个张扬的微笑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>哈哈，一声标准的战吼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阿加尼佩叹了口气，向前几步，走到她身边。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"656601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/50/HeadIconSmall-656601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-656601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"656601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/50/HeadIconSmall-656601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-656601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/50/HeadIconSmall-656601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-656601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿加尼佩：</div><div>我可不敢挑战我们最强大的战士。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"656601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/50/HeadIconSmall-656601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-656601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"656601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/50/HeadIconSmall-656601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-656601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/50/HeadIconSmall-656601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-656601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿加尼佩：</div><div>祭祀即将开始，你为什么躲在这里？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>欧洛斯会处理好的。那不是我的工作。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>祭祀场地在他们所处位置的正下方。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阿加尼佩能看到他们已经点起了火盆，把牺牲绑在了矮柱上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"656601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/50/HeadIconSmall-656601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-656601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"656601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/50/HeadIconSmall-656601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-656601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/50/HeadIconSmall-656601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-656601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿加尼佩：</div><div>你是族中的领航者，大家期待你在所有重大场合中出席。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"656601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/50/HeadIconSmall-656601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-656601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"656601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/50/HeadIconSmall-656601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-656601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/50/HeadIconSmall-656601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-656601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿加尼佩：</div><div>欧洛斯毕竟不是战士……许多凯迈昂人只尊重强者。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"656601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/50/HeadIconSmall-656601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-656601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"656601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/50/HeadIconSmall-656601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-656601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/50/HeadIconSmall-656601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-656601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿加尼佩：</div><div>族中最近对欧洛斯颇有微词，因为他并不赞成这场远征……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_9_bg_09.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_9_bg_09\"><img alt=\"3_9_bg_09\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b0/Cg-3_9_bg_09.png/600px-Cg-3_9_bg_09.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b0/Cg-3_9_bg_09.png/900px-Cg-3_9_bg_09.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b0/Cg-3_9_bg_09.png/1200px-Cg-3_9_bg_09.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>赫多涅耸了耸肩膀，把注意力重新转移到风暴上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"315615.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/74/HeadIconSmall-315615.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-315615.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"315615.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/74/HeadIconSmall-315615.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-315615.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/74/HeadIconSmall-315615.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-315615.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>我正在构想征战的路线。你瞧，风暴太过强烈，它会撕碎我们的船只！我们需要能操控风的神秘术……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"656601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/50/HeadIconSmall-656601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-656601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"656601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/50/HeadIconSmall-656601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-656601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/50/HeadIconSmall-656601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-656601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿加尼佩：</div><div>祭祀正是为此举行。在征战之前，我们需要诸神的祝福……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"315616.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-315616.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-315616.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"315616.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-315616.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-315616.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-315616.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-315616.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>哈，诸神！正是预言把我们引到这里的——怎么说的来着？“围绕火山的岛屿，命中注定的第二故乡。凯迈昂人将再度复兴，拥有数不清的财富和力量。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"315616.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-315616.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-315616.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"315616.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-315616.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-315616.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-315616.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-315616.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>然而我们到了这里一看，好极了！狂风暴雨！活火山——甚至可能还有一只怪物！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"315615.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/74/HeadIconSmall-315615.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-315615.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"315615.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/74/HeadIconSmall-315615.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-315615.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/74/HeadIconSmall-315615.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-315615.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>但我不讨厌这种恶趣味的玩笑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>赫多涅对着风暴眯起了双眼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"315621.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/HeadIconSmall-315621.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-315621.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"315621.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/HeadIconSmall-315621.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-315621.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/HeadIconSmall-315621.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-315621.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>我已经很久……没有挑战真正强大的敌人了。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_9_bg_10.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_9_bg_10\"><img alt=\"3_9_bg_10\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/19/Cg-3_9_bg_10.png/600px-Cg-3_9_bg_10.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/19/Cg-3_9_bg_10.png/900px-Cg-3_9_bg_10.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/19/Cg-3_9_bg_10.png/1200px-Cg-3_9_bg_10.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>祭司抓了一把大麦粉，举手高唱。风为他们携来了轻飘飘的祷词。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"656720.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/86/HeadIconSmall-656720.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-656720.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"656720.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/86/HeadIconSmall-656720.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-656720.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/86/HeadIconSmall-656720.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-656720.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">欧洛斯：</div><div>你从前庇佑我们，赐予我们荣誉……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"656601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/50/HeadIconSmall-656601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-656601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"656601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/50/HeadIconSmall-656601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-656601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/50/HeadIconSmall-656601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-656601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿加尼佩：</div><div>……如果诸神允许远征，我想加入你的队伍。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>哦？啊，我想起来了——你刚刚通过战士的枪术考核。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>但你之前只做过一些集市护卫的工作，这次远征对于新兵而言过于危险——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"656601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/50/HeadIconSmall-656601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-656601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"656601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/50/HeadIconSmall-656601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-656601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/50/HeadIconSmall-656601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-656601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿加尼佩：</div><div>我已经成年了！我和你同岁！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"656601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/50/HeadIconSmall-656601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-656601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"656601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/50/HeadIconSmall-656601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-656601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/50/HeadIconSmall-656601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-656601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿加尼佩：</div><div>但好几年之前，你就可以独自在水下捕猎，为家族的航船护航……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阿加尼佩微微垂下了头，但随即被一记重拳猛击了后背。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>哈哈！别和我比！我可是天赐的大力士！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>我们凯迈昂人热爱危险，如果你有勇气直面怪物，我当然会带上你！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>你的奶奶“倪克斯”阿加尼佩是一位强大的战士，也是我可靠的队友。她会为你骄傲的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"656601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/50/HeadIconSmall-656601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-656601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"656601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/50/HeadIconSmall-656601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-656601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/50/HeadIconSmall-656601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-656601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿加尼佩：</div><div>嗯……她的灵魂想必已经去往了至福乐土，我不会有负于她的名字！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"656601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/50/HeadIconSmall-656601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-656601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"656601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/50/HeadIconSmall-656601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-656601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/50/HeadIconSmall-656601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-656601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿加尼佩：</div><div>看，他们要献祭了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>祭司抬起牛犊的头颅，暴露出脆弱的喉咙。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"656720.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/86/HeadIconSmall-656720.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-656720.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"656720.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/86/HeadIconSmall-656720.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-656720.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/86/HeadIconSmall-656720.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-656720.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">欧洛斯：</div><div>我们为您献上纯白的牛犊，请保佑我们的战士，杀死他们面前的所有敌人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>……嗯？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>濒临死亡的牛犊开始挣扎哀嚎，与赫多涅之前见证过的无数仪式并无不同。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"656601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/50/HeadIconSmall-656601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-656601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"656601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/50/HeadIconSmall-656601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-656601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/50/HeadIconSmall-656601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-656601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿加尼佩：</div><div>我希望诸神答允我们……我需要在战斗中证明自己的力量，赫多涅。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"656601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/50/HeadIconSmall-656601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-656601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"656601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/50/HeadIconSmall-656601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-656601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/50/HeadIconSmall-656601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-656601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿加尼佩：</div><div>我需要更多的胜利！就像你一样！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阿加尼佩转头看向身旁的人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"656601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/50/HeadIconSmall-656601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-656601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"656601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/50/HeadIconSmall-656601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-656601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/50/HeadIconSmall-656601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-656601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿加尼佩：</div><div>赫多涅，你说——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>赫多涅跃下了山崖。她在陡峭的崖壁间弹跳几次，眨眼便到了谷底。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"656601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/50/HeadIconSmall-656601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-656601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"656601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/50/HeadIconSmall-656601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-656601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/50/HeadIconSmall-656601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-656601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿加尼佩：</div><div>赫多涅，你去哪儿——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这句话还没有说完，阿加尼佩就看到了战士不告而别的原因。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"656601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/50/HeadIconSmall-656601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-656601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"656601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/50/HeadIconSmall-656601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-656601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/50/HeadIconSmall-656601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-656601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿加尼佩：</div><div>……？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在她刚刚转头的时候，祭台中央的牛犊已经挣开了绳索。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>它掀翻了阻拦的祭司，一路撞出呆滞的人群，冲入岛屿的密林之中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>而在牛犊之后，紧咬着一抹离弦之箭般的红色身影。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"315616.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-315616.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-315616.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"315616.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-315616.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-315616.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-315616.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-315616.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>无需担心！我去把它抓回来！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_zhou.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"linzhongxiuqichu_zhou\"><img alt=\"linzhongxiuqichu_zhou\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6b/Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_zhou.png/600px-Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_zhou.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6b/Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_zhou.png/900px-Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_zhou.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6b/Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_zhou.png/1200px-Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_zhou.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在茂叶的遮拢下，林间阴沉，让人难以分辨事物的轮廓。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一支金箭擦过牛背，飞入更黑暗的树林深处。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"315613.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/HeadIconSmall-315613.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-315613.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"315613.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/HeadIconSmall-315613.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-315613.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/HeadIconSmall-315613.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-315613.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>啧……手生了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>牛犊钻入茂密的灌木，在赫多涅眼前失去了踪影。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她拨开林木，循着地上的足迹前进。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"315613.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/HeadIconSmall-315613.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-315613.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"315613.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/HeadIconSmall-315613.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-315613.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/HeadIconSmall-315613.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-315613.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>我第一次见祭品逃跑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"315613.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/HeadIconSmall-315613.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-315613.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"315613.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/HeadIconSmall-315613.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-315613.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/HeadIconSmall-315613.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-315613.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>我们做了什么，让你……让哪位神明如此发狂？</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-linzhongshandong.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"linzhongshandong\"><img alt=\"linzhongshandong\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/Cg-linzhongshandong.png/600px-Cg-linzhongshandong.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/Cg-linzhongshandong.png/900px-Cg-linzhongshandong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/Cg-linzhongshandong.png/1200px-Cg-linzhongshandong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>林间的喧嚣止息了。赫多涅抽出羽箭，放轻了脚步。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>牛犊的足迹终结于一处洞穴前。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_4_bg_dixiasuidao.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_4_bg_dixiasuidao\"><img alt=\"1_4_bg_dixiasuidao\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/Cg-1_4_bg_dixiasuidao.png/600px-Cg-1_4_bg_dixiasuidao.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/Cg-1_4_bg_dixiasuidao.png/900px-Cg-1_4_bg_dixiasuidao.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/Cg-1_4_bg_dixiasuidao.png/1200px-Cg-1_4_bg_dixiasuidao.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>洞穴尽头的上方开了一个小洞口，这使得赫多涅可以勉强看清此处的情形。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>白色的牛犊温顺地躺倒在地，旁边站着一位堪堪到她腰部的女孩。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女孩有一头黎明般的玫红色长发，眼尾高挑，总让人觉得盛气凌人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>赫多涅费了些时间，才从尚显稚嫩的五官上辨认出她的身份。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她认识这张脸——这是幼时的她自己。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"653302.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/32/HeadIconSmall-653302.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-653302.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"653302.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/32/HeadIconSmall-653302.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-653302.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/32/HeadIconSmall-653302.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-653302.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>你好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>呵，我小时候从来不和人说“你好”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>赫多涅收起弓箭，饶有趣味地看着眼前的另一个自己。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>你是哪一位神明？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她听过许多类似的故事。神明化为凡人，为英雄指点出路……或是将他们引入死地。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>我没想到，你们如今还有这种……扮演小孩的兴趣。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>缩小版的“冒牌货”平静地看着她。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>这世界太过无聊，只有战斗才能让我觉得快乐。我不需要财富，缺少的只是乐趣。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>团结是弱者才会玩的游戏，强大的战士不需要朋友。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>我，欧多拉，是一只孤傲的鹰，注定要走上英雄的道路！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>……自从有了称号，我很久没听到这个名字了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>八岁时的生日发言并不会让我觉得尴尬。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>我并不想让你觉得尴尬，只是想让你觉得我更易亲近。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>这个幼时的形象只是我在此地的映射，而非真实的我。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>这些是你说过的话。自大、狂妄、追求生死的乐趣——这就是你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女孩无视了赫多涅的沉默，对着她礼貌地点了点头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">火山：</div><div>我是火山本身的意志，这座岛受我的力量统辖。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">火山：</div><div>我看到你们追逐“预言”，越过巨浪而来；你们懂得向神明献祭的礼节，使用箭矛与斯库拉战斗——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>你无需重复我已经知道的事情。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">火山：</div><div>但很遗憾，这里并不适合作为你们的繁衍之地。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">火山：</div><div>有一头巨兽盘踞在火山上，它的力量带来了风暴与骤火。火山每天都在喷发。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>所以，你想劝我们离开？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>火山温柔地抚摸着牛犊，后者发出满足的哞声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">火山：</div><div>不。赫多涅，我想与你做个交易。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">火山：</div><div>我想让你和你的族人杀死提丰。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>提丰？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>赫多涅感觉自己的心跳停止了一瞬——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>众神的敌人，神话中的巨兽？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>心脏在她胸膛强烈地鼓动，兴奋几乎要把她的头脑淹没。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">火山：</div><div>不错。它强大、暴虐，挑战者很可能死于它的风暴、流火或毒牙。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>对方的表情没有任何变化，仿佛在说一桩平常的谷物交易。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">火山：</div><div>但我能提供的报酬十分丰厚。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">火山：</div><div>若你胜利，你将是新的火山之主，我将会赐予你无穷的力量……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">火山：</div><div>我会让你变得比提丰更强大。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>……还不够。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">火山：</div><div>不够？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>赫多涅强压下兴奋的心情，抬高交易的筹码。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>这里该是我们的第二故乡，繁衍之地。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">火山：</div><div>当然，如果你想要如此。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">火山：</div><div>在火山岛上，胜者就是一切。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>没有任何讨价还价。赫多涅很少遇到如此乖巧的交易对象。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>……对我来说，这确实是一桩公平的交易：高风险、高回报。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>但你无法从中得到任何利益。这往往暗示着骗局。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">火山：</div><div>我不需要利益。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">火山：</div><div>提丰远比岛上的其他怪物更加强大，它的统治是绝对的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">火山：</div><div>一成不变的统治，让我觉得无趣。但裁判不能加入比赛，我无法直接驱逐它。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>熟悉的女孩咧开了嘴，露出了一个标准的笑容。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">火山：</div><div>与你一样，我想要乐趣。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>……哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>赫多涅爆发出一阵愉快的大笑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">火山：</div><div>哈哈哈哈哈哈！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>火山的笑声紧随其后，在空荡荡的岩壁间回荡。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>看来我没什么拒绝的理由。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">火山：</div><div>你不害怕死亡？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>我不会失败。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">火山：</div><div>你可能失去更多。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>火山慢慢走到她身前，握紧她的手腕。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">火山：</div><div>但我不在意。杀了它，把它的眼睛带给我。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">火山：</div><div>作为交易成立的凭据，我给你一件礼物。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>赫多涅看着自己的金甲开始熔化，它们流淌、变形……重塑为两个完美的圆环。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">火山：</div><div>外围的风暴很危险，这里的海兽识得它们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>臂膀上的金环闪闪发亮。赫多涅轻弹了一下，听到几声清冽的脆响。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>一件新收藏品，还算漂亮。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>你说呢——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她没有得到任何回应。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阴暗的洞穴内空无一人，只剩下牛犊熟睡的鼾声。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "凡人或英雄-02"}}